<title>USA: IPO Pricing - Superior Consultant above range.</title>
<headline>IPO Pricing - Superior Consultant above range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	 Superior Consultant Holdings Corp</p>
<p>   Priced At				    $16.00</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $13-$15</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,500,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter	   William Blair &amp; Co</p>
<p>Note: The shares were increased to 2.5 million from 2.15 million.</p>
<p>Superior Consultant is a healthcare consulting firm.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
